  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/04/IMG_3558.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El grupo Crash ofreci&oacute; anoche en el pabell&oacute;n Vila d&#39;Onda, dentro de la Pascua Musical,&nbsp;una buena raci&oacute;n de versiones de pop-rock, desde poco m&aacute;s de las 12 hasta las 4.20 de la madrugada, aunque con un largo descanso, que hizo que la actuaci&oacute;n se les quedara corta a muchas personas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupocrashdomingopascua/img_3525.jpg\" alt=\"img_3525\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupocrashdomingopascua/img_3526.jpg\" alt=\"img_3526\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupocrashdomingopascua/img_3527.jpg\" alt=\"img_3527\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupocrashdomingopascua/img_3528.jpg\" alt=\"img_3528\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupocrashdomingopascua/img_3529.jpg\" alt=\"img_3529\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupocrashdomingopascua/img_3530.jpg\" alt=\"img_3530\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupocrashdomingopascua/img_3531.jpg\" alt=\"img_3531\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupocrashdomingopascua/img_3532.jpg\" alt=\"img_3532\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grupocrashdomingopascua/img_3533.jpg\" alt=\"img_3533\" style=\"max-width:100%;heigh